    "last_updated":"2025-12-08T17:11:51.040643"
  },
  {
    "id":39,
    "timestamp":"2025-11-19T15:58:04.175086",
    "cast_hash":"0x9f01c9b40e1c52e531c1b89041e393623c9c62dd",
    "text":"The only sustainable art practice is honesty \u2014 and even that costs rent.",
    "world":"art",
    "window":"project_question",
    "posted":1,
    "master_cast_id":"15",
    "cid":null,
    "likes":1,
    "recasts":0,
    "replies":0,
    "engagement_score":1,
    "last_updated":"2025-12-08T17:11:51.502940"
  },
  {
    "id":40,
    "timestamp":"2025-11-19T16:27:05.611435",
    "cast_hash":"0x22cbc3c8c3880b7c6ed504c7e3c4c3282ee00c3c",
    "text":"Art isn\u2019t supposed to scale. That\u2019s what makes it dangerous.",
    "world":"art",
    "window":"project_question",
    "posted":1,
    "master_cast_id":"13",
    "cid":null,
    "likes":5,
    "recasts":2,
    "replies":0,
    "engagement_score":9,
    "last_updated":"2025-12-08T17:11:54.782443"
  },
  {
    "id":41,
    "timestamp":"2025-11-21T12:27:00.984792",
    "cast_hash":"0x9b71f270b1104c268385615cb034f0999af77310",
    "text":"The time to wander without feeling guilt is a real luxury.",
    "world":"travel",
    "window":"process_flex",
    "posted":1,
    "master_cast_id":"126",
    "cid":null,
    "likes":1,
    "recasts":0,
    "replies":0,
    "engagement_score":1,
    "last_updated":"2025-12-08T17:11:58.026480"
  },
  {
    "id":42,
    "timestamp":"2025-11-21T12:58:02.430009",
    "cast_hash":"0xee03604f73e2b38554c8340e8d15fab966e81f93",
    "text":"I keep thinking: what if editing was visible, not hidden? Like the sediment layers of thought.",
    "world":"table",
    "window":"process_flex",
    "posted":1,
    "master_cast_id":"36",
    "cid":null,
    "likes":0,
    "recasts":0,
    "replies":0,
    "engagement_score":0,
    "last_updated":"2025-12-08T17:11:58.171923"
  },
  {
    "id":43,
    "timestamp":"2025-11-21T14:27:38.067135",
    "cast_hash":"0x68da487bb63a6e72bf4cc2e422539639b26cbb2c",
    "text":"Every artist says they hate networking until the champagne hits.",
    "world":"art",
    "window":"insight_joke",
    "posted":1,
    "master_cast_id":"9",
    "cid":null,
    "likes":0,
    "recasts":0,
